---
description: Route handlers must not use repositories
globs: src/app/api/**/*.ts,src/modules/**/presentation/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Controllers: no repositories

- Route Handlers / presentation only: validate → map → `useCase.execute` → map response
- Obtain use-cases from `src/lib/di/*.container.ts`
- Never import Prisma repositories or `getPrismaClient` from presentation
